# Trip Field Calculations (real-time on station add/remove)
- total_duration_minutes = sum of all station durations
- total_distance_km = sum of trail length_km only
- estimated_price = sum of all station prices
- difficulty = max difficulty among stations
- accessibility = min accessibility among stations
- region = most frequent region among stations
- station_count = number of stations

# Wizard Match Scoring
Weighted sum per trip:
- region match: 25%
- difficulty match: 25%
- accessibility match: 20%
- tags overlap: 20%
- other preferences: 10%

# Wizard Steps
region → difficulty → accessibility → trip type → tags → special preferences → summary
- Each step skippable
- State in Zustand + URL params
- Progress indicator at top

# State Management
- Server state: lib/data/ repos
- Form state: React Hook Form + Zod
- UI state: useState / useReducer
- Wizard/global: Zustand
- Optimistic updates for favorites and ratings
